{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Less than a month later, the US had convinced Morocco to quietly defy China and release Idris. On 12 February, Zeynure got a call to say her husband was out of prison and travelling with his lawyer to a hotel in Casablanca. From there he was taken to the UN offices and then the US embassy in the city as he waited to board a flight to Washington DC. But there was to be no public announcement of his freedom as everyone involved, including Zeynure, was sworn to secrecy.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Even with the US agreeing to rescue him there was a fear of what could happen if the Chinese found out Idris had been released before he had left Morocco. \u8220 I worried he wouldn\u8217 t make it on to the plane, but they [the lawyers] said there wouldn\u8217 t be any problem because there were some American officials from the embassy who would go with him. I was crying and laughing. My emotions were all over the place,\u8221  says Zeynure.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 On the evening of 14 February 2025, Zeynure finally got the call the family had been waiting for: Idris was safe. He had arrived in Washington.}{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb240\sa0
\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 But for Zeynure and the children, the wait for the family to be reunited went on. Idris was granted a visa to stay in the US, but was told that applying for his family to be able to join him would likely take many years. Fearing the Trump administration\u8217 s growing }
